<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Unfair discrimination and misrepresentation"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.1> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AI exposing users to harmful, abusive, unsafe or inappropriate content. May involve AI creating, describing, providing advice, or encouraging action. Examples of toxic content include hate-speech, violence, extremism, illegal acts, child sexual abuse material, as well as content that violates community norms such as profanity, inflammatory political speech, or pornography." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "1.2" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Exposure to toxic content" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Exposure to toxic content"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.2> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Accuracy and effectiveness of AI decisions and actions is dependent on group membership, where decisions in AI system design and biased training data lead to unequal outcomes, reduced benefits, increased effort, and alienation of users." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "1.3" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Unequal performance across groups" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Unequal performance across groups"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-1.3> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AI systems that memorize and leak sensitive personal data or infer private information about individuals without their consent. Unexpected or unauthorized sharing of data and information can compromise user expectation of privacy, assist identity theft, or loss of confidential intellectual property." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "2.1" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Compromise of privacy by obtaining, leaking or correctly inferring sensitive information" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Compromise of privacy by obtaining, leaking or correctly inferring sensitive information"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.1> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Vulnerabilities in AI systems, software development toolchains, and hardware that can be exploited, resulting in unauthorized access, data and privacy breaches, or system manipulation causing unsafe outputs or behavior." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "2.2" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "AI system security vulnerabilities and attacks" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AI system security vulnerabilities and attacks"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-2.2> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AI systems that inadvertently generate or spread incorrect or deceptive information, which can lead to inaccurate beliefs in users and undermine their autonomy. Humans that make decisions based on false beliefs can experience physical, emotional or material harms" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "3.1" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "False or misleading information" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#Risk> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "False or misleading information"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.1> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.2> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Highly personalized AI-generated misinformation creating “filter bubbles” where individuals only see what matches their existing beliefs, undermining shared reality, weakening social cohesion and political processes." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.2> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "3.2" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.2> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Pollution of information ecosystem and loss of consensus reality" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-3.2> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
