<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.5> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Inadequate regulatory frameworks and oversight mechanisms failing to keep pace with AI development, leading to ineffective governance and the inability to manage AI risks appropriately." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.5> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "6.5" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.5> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Governance failure" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.5> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
