<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.6> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "The development and operation of AI systems causing environmental harm, such as through energy consumption of data centers, or material and carbon footprints associated with AI hardware." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.6> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "6.6" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.6> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Environmental harm" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-6.6> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
