<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lack of capability or robustness"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.3> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.3> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.4> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Challenges in understanding or explaining the decision-making processes of AI systems, which can lead to mistrust, difficulty in enforcing compliance standards or holding relevant actors accountable for harms, and the inability to identify and correct errors." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.4> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "7.4" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.4> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Lack of transparency or interpretability" .
