<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.4> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.4> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.5> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Ethical considerations regarding the treatment of potentially sentient AI entities, including discussions around their potential rights and welfare, particularly as AI systems become more advanced and autonomous." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.5> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "7.5" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.5> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "AI welfare and rights" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-7.5> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
